# Build context of go/Dockerfile.afrotransact-go and go/services/*/Dockerfile is go/. The workspace needs go.work, go.work.sum, apps/, pkg/
# and services/ (including config, migrations and data that //go:embed reads), so only what `go build` never reads is excluded.
# Keep dist/ (the prebuilt binary of --build-arg BIN_FROM=prebuilt) in the context.
**/*_test.go
**/*.test
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/coverage.out
**/bin
**/node_modules
